### 1. Listar todos los productos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 2. Buscar por nombre
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?q=laptop

### 3. Obtener uno por id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 4. Crear un producto (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teclado mecánico",
  "description": "Switches rojos",
  "price": 49.90,
  "stock": 15,
  "category": "electronica"
}

### 5. Actualizar el producto 2
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mouse inalámbrico Pro",
  "description": "Bluetooth, 5 botones",
  "price": 29.90,
  "stock": 35,
  "category": "electronica"
}

### 6. Eliminar el producto 5 (204; si repites: 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/5

### 7. Producto inexistente (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/999

### 8. Datos inválidos (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": 0,
  "stock": -1,
  "category": ""
}
